    <mainContent>
        <article id="about">
            <title>About This Project</title>
            <paragraph>Unlike standard HTML pages, this layout splits content from presentation. The XML file houses raw structured data, while an external XSLT file handles rendering, colors, and layout mechanics.</paragraph>
        </article>
        
        <article id="features">
            <title>Why Use XML for Content?</title>
            <paragraph>XML makes data highly portable, highly searchable, and completely independent of any single platform layout rule.</paragraph>
        </article>
